# A server that accepts us and drops us after 10 s keeps escalating:
# failures reset only after a link has stayed online for 60 s.
! connect
> dial #1 irc.test:6667 plain
? notice Connecting to irc.test:6667
! opened
> CAP LS 302
> NICK textual
> USER textual 0 * Textual
